Repository   → loads/saves domain entities (commands only)
               e.g. IEquipmentRepository.GetAsync(id) → EquipmentAsset

ReadService  → DTOs from DB for queries (search, paging, one-off reads)
               e.g. IEquipmentReadService.SearchAsync(page, size, ...) → PagedResult<EquipmentListItem>

Directory    → keyed DTO lookup, meant to be cached
               e.g. IEquipmentDirectory.GetAsync(id) → GetEquipment.Response

Reader       → reads from non-DB source (e.g. file)
               e.g. IEquipmentCatalogueReader.GetCatalogueAsync() → IReadOnlyList<CatalogueItem>

Api          → wraps external HTTP API
               e.g. IBillingApi.WhoAmIAsync() → DownstreamIdentity

Service      → published in *.Contracts for other modules
               e.g. IEquipmentReservationService.ReserveAsync(requestId, category) → EquipmentReservationResult
